00","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"0","bbox":[159.786,480.56021,165.34599,490.56021],"origin":[159.786,488.28702],"font":"Helvetica","size":10.0,"colour":"#333333","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"1","bbox":[159.786,454.21021,165.34599,464.21021],"origin":[159.786,461.93701],"font":"Helvetica","size":10.0,"colour":"#333333","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"2","bbox":[159.786,427.8602,165.34599,437.8602],"origin":[159.786,435.58701],"font":"Helvetica","size":10.0,"colour":"#333333","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"3","bbox":[159.786,401.51019,165.34599,411.51019],"origin":[159.786,409.237],"font":"Helvetica","size":10.0,"colour":"#333333","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"4","bbox":[159.786,375.17038,165.34599,385.17038],"origin":[159.786,382.89719],"font":"Helvetica","size":10.0,"colour":"#333333","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"5","bbox":[159.786,348.82037,165.34599,358.82037],"origin":[159.786,356.54718],"font":"Helvetica","size":10.0,"colour":"#333333","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"6","bbox":[159.786,322.47037,165.34599,332.47037],"origin":[159.786,330.19717],"font":"Helvetica","size":10.0,"colour":"#333333","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"7","bbox":[159.786,296.12036,165.34599,306.12036],"origin":[159.786,303.84717],"font":"Helvetica","size":10.0,"colour":"#333333","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Interpretation","bbox":[34.3465,513.09253,124.57652,527.09253],"origin":[34.3465,523.91003],"font":"Helvetica-Bold","size":14.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"The client's Positive Childhood Experiences (PCEs) score is 6 out of 7, which falls in the High","bbox":[91.0394,532.34808,544.92157,543.34808],"origin":[91.0394,540.84753],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"range. This indicates a robust number of protective childhood experiences. In the general","bbox":[91.0394,544.44806,524.52747,555.44806],"origin":[91.0394,552.94751],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"population, approximately 52% of individuals report 6-7 PCEs. This profile suggests the client","bbox":[91.0394,556.54803,544.06342,567.54803],"origin":[91.0394,565.04749],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"had access to substantial protective factors in childhood.","bbox":[91.0394,568.64807,366.17136,579.64807],"origin":[91.0394,577.14752],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Scoring and Interpretation Information","bbox":[34.3464,608.17841,290.26636,622.17841],"origin":[34.3464,618.99591],"font":"Helvetica-Bold","size":14.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"For comprehensive information on the PCEs scale, ","bbox":[91.0393,627.43396,342.3013,638.43396],"origin":[91.0393,635.93341],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"see here","bbox":[342.302,627.43457,385.103,638.43457],"origin":[342.302,635.93402],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#0000ff","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":".","bbox":[385.10199,627.43457,388.16,638.43457],"origin":[385.10199,635.93402],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"The PCEs provides a single total score where scores range from 0-7. The PCEs uses a Likert","bbox":[91.039,651.63458,545.87811,662.63458],"origin":[91.039,660.13403],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"response format but only response options of “Most of the time” or “All of the time” are","bbox":[91.039,663.73456,508.59906,674.73456],"origin":[91.039,672.23401],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"indicative of a positive experience being present (a score of 1) whereas all other response","bbox":[91.039,675.83459,528.17902,686.83459],"origin":[91.039,684.33405],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"options represent an absence of the positive experience (a score of 0). The total score","bbox":[91.039,687.93457,510.46899,698.93457],"origin":[91.039,696.43402],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"represents the sum of all positive childhood experiences endorsed, providing a comprehensive","bbox":[91.039,700.03461,550.79504,711.03461],"origin":[91.039,708.53406],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"measure of protective factors that research links to enhanced resilience and better mental health","bbox":[91.039,712.13458,559.98004,723.13458],"origin":[91.039,720.63403],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"outcomes even in the presence of childhood adversity.","bbox":[91.039,724.23456,356.39194,735.23456],"origin":[91.039,732.73401],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"For clinical interpretation, PCEs scores are categorised into three qualitative descriptors:","bbox":[91.039,748.43457,520.80896,759.43457],"origin":[91.039,756.93402],"font":"Helvetica","size":11.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]},{"text":"Page 1 of 2","bbox":[510.23599,809.92755,561.38611,819.92755],"origin":[510.23599,817.65436],"font":"Helvetica","size":10.0,"colour":"#000000","direction":[1.0,0.0]}],"tables":[],"chartObservations":[{"id":"chart_1","title":"Positive Childhood Experiences (PCEs) Score","type":"vertical_bar","bboxPt":[170.346,298.347,450.346,484.787],"widthPt":280.0,"heightPt":186.44,"axisColour":"#333333","xAxis":{"status":"unresolved","ticks":[{"value":0.0,"positionPt":162.565995,"text":"0","colour":"#333333"}],"title":"The client's Positive Childhood Experiences (PCEs) score is 6 out of 7, which falls in the High"},"yAxis":{"status":"linear_ticks_observed","ticks":[{"value":7.0,"positionPt":301.12036,"text":"7","colour":"#333333"},{"value":6.0,"positionPt":327.47037,"text":"6","colour":"#333333"},{"value":5.0,"positionPt":353.82037,"te